# Written by the unit-test JVM: fabric-loader-junit resolves FabricLoader's config dir to
# <repo>/config, so CommandsSpyConfig.load() creates a default commands-spy.json there, and
# log4j-core writes logs/latest.log. Neither is build output, so /build does not cover them.
